Description: run an existing Microsoft Dev Tunnel as a systemd user service
 devtunnel-service supervises an existing persistent Microsoft Dev Tunnel with
 a systemd user service, restarts its host and renews the tunnel's 30-day lease
 daily. It uses the devtunnel CLI's existing login and refuses to host tunnels
 that allow anonymous access or expose ports other than the configured ones.
 .
 The devtunnel CLI is not packaged by Debian or Ubuntu and is not installed by
 this package. Install and sign in to Microsoft's CLI separately; see
 /usr/share/doc/devtunnel-service/README.Debian.
